    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents are proud to present 4 Dodsborough Cottages, a beautiful 2 bedroom semi-detached home with an amazing c.88 foot long garden to the rear. This property boasts a fantastic location in one of Lucan's most desirable developments and includes spacious garages, a gated driveway and gated pedestrian side access.\n\nCharming homes like this rarely come to the market, 4 Dodsborough Cottages measures c.62 sq.m/667 sq.ft and provides excellent potential to extend if required. The property benefits from modern fitted double-glazed windows, rewiring in 2020, oil fired central heating and a multi fuel stove within the living room. \n\nThe property further benefits from the spacious garages which measure c.40 foot wide x 26 foot long, excluding the wooden sheds. Including the garages, this private garden measures c.88 foot long c.35 foot wide and benefits from gated pedestrian side access. To the front it a large gated driveway, with the property overlooking a picturesque green area. \n\nLight filled accommodation downstairs comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, dual aspect living room and a dual aspect kitchen/dining with access to the garden. Upstairs are two spacious bedrooms (One double and one single) and a fully tiled bathroom. \n\nThe location in Dodsborough Cottages is highly regarded due to its peaceful setting yet close proximity to local amenities such as shops, schools and cafés. Ideally located just minutes from Lucan village with its host of eateries, pubs and shops. Also, within close proximity of the N4/M4/M50/M7, QBC, Nitelink, Tesco, Supervalu & The Liffey Valley shopping centres, as well as a host of other amenities that include schools, public transport, parks and sporting facilities.\n\nLucan is a most sought-after Dublin suburb situated 13 km west of Dublin city centre. There are some fantastic leisure facilities in the area including GAA clubs, soccer clubs, water sports along the River Liffey and is home to some of Dublin's finest parks including St Catherine's Park, Griffeen Valley Park and the nearby Castletown House. Phoenix Park, the largest enclosed public park in any capital city in Europe, is less than a 15 minute drive away. There are fantastic primary and secondary schools in the Lucan area, including Gael Scoils. Located only a short drive from Liffey Valley Shopping Centre and close to a number of large multinational companies such as Pfizer, Aryzta, Takeda and Intel.\n\nViewing by appointment via selling agents DNG Lucan, Phone 01-6280400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - \nWelcoming entrance hallway with doors to....\n\nLiving Room - \nSpacious dual aspect living room wood flooring, tv point and a feature multi fuel stove\n\nKitchen/Dining - \nLarge light filled kitchen/dining ith a modern fitted kitchen, wood flooring, access to the garden and sold inclusive of kitchen appliances\n\nLanding - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - \nSpacious daul aspect master bedroom with built in wardrobes and wood flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - \nSingle bedroom to the front with wood flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled bathroom with a bath, wc, whb and chrome towel rail\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Beautiful 2 semi-detached home</li><li> Spacious c.88 foot long x c.35 foot wide garden (Incl garages)</li><li> Spacious garage: 26 ft long x 40 foot wide</li><li> Amazing location</li><li> Large gated driveway to the front</li><li> Gated pedestrian side access</li><li> Rewired c.2020</li><li> Modern fitted double-glazed windows</li><li> Oil fired central heating</li><li> Multi fuel stove in the living room</li><li> Overlooking a picturesque green area to the front</li><li> Next to shops, schools and transport links</li><li> Easy access to city centre & Dublin Airport</li><li> Convenient to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre</ul>"
      },
